[[{"kind": "text", "text": "VTrust AI Vision", "x": 42, "y": 32, "size": 23, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 34.04, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "从翻房 SaaS，到公司的 AI Operating System", "x": 42, "y": 67, "size": 15, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 22.2, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "内部试用方向会  |  9/17 14:00  |  Ryan · George（PM）· Jessie · VP", "x": 42, "y": 96, "size": 10, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 14.8, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 120, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "一句话愿景", "x": 42, "y": 135, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "让员工在工作中顺手留下信息，让负责人掌握进展，让管理层问得到有依据的答案。先从翻房业务验证，再把有效做法逐步扩展到公司其他业务。", "x": 42, "y": 161, "size": 12, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 35.519999999999996, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "员工少填表", "x": 42.0, "y": 208.51999999999998, "size": 12, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 17.759999999999998, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "一句话、一张照片，整理成项目记录或待确认的任务更新。", "x": 42.0, "y": 233.51999999999998, "size": 10.7, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 31.671999999999997, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "负责人少催进度", "x": 216.42519685039372, "y": 208.51999999999998, "size": 12, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 17.759999999999998, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "看清谁在做、卡在哪里、缺什么，以及下一步找谁。", "x": 216.42519685039372, "y": 233.51999999999998, "size": 10.7, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 31.671999999999997, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "管理层少追问", "x": 390.85039370078744, "y": 208.51999999999998, "size": 12, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 17.759999999999998, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "问“哪些房子卡住了”，能看到原因、负责人、来源和更新时间。", "x": 390.85039370078744, "y": 233.51999999999998, "size": 10.7, "w": 162.42519685039372, "h": 31.671999999999997, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "用一个现场场景检验方向", "x": 42, "y": 312.52, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "现场人员：“橱柜拆完了，电工明天来，墙面先别封。”", "x": 42, "y": 338.52, "size": 12, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 17.759999999999998, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "目标体验：关联到具体房屋和原始照片／语音 → 整理为更新建议 → 由有权限的人确认 → 任务与总览同步。管理层随后可以直接查询卡点。", "x": 42, "y": 363.28, "size": 11.5, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 34.04, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "关键边界：现场说“完成”是待核实的报告；AI 可以提建议，关键审批和任务完成仍按业务规则确认。以上为目标场景，尚不代表已实现。", "x": 42, "y": 404.32, "size": 10.5, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 31.08, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "各部分负责什么，用业务语言讲清楚", "x": 42, "y": 452.4, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "微信／企微", "x": 42, "y": 478.4, "size": 11, "w": 106, "h": 16.28, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "计划中的便捷入口；具体接入方式、可获取的消息及授权范围待验证。", "x": 155, "y": 478.4, "size": 10.6, "w": 398.27559055118115, "h": 15.687999999999999, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "现有业务网站", "x": 42, "y": 502.08799999999997, "size": 11, "w": 106, "h": 16.28, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "安排任务、核对记录、查看资料和审批的工作台。", "x": 155, "y": 502.08799999999997, "size": 10.6, "w": 398.27559055118115, "h": 15.687999999999999, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "AI 智能助手", "x": 42, "y": 525.776, "size": 11, "w": 106, "h": 16.28, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "理解材料、整理信息、回答问题；答案有来源，操作受权限约束。", "x": 155, "y": 525.776, "size": 10.6, "w": 398.27559055118115, "h": 15.687999999999999, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "AWS 云基础设施", "x": 42, "y": 549.4639999999999, "size": 11, "w": 106, "h": 16.28, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "承载应用、保存资料与记录，支持权限、备份和持续运行。", "x": 155, "y": 549.4639999999999, "size": 10.6, "w": 398.27559055118115, "h": 15.687999999999999, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "今天的边界与会议节奏", "x": 42, "y": 581.1519999999999, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "现状：进度报告页已可用；主业务的账号权限、任务交接、手机操作仍需验收。先跑通真实流程，再验证 AI 整理与查询，最后才讨论跨业务扩展。", "x": 42, "y": 607.1519999999999, "size": 11, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 32.56, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "建议 45 分钟：5 分钟现状与愿景 → 10 分钟真实案例 → 20 分钟六项决定 → 5 分钟手机看报告 → 5 分钟复述结论。", "x": 42, "y": 647.712, "size": 11, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 32.56, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "今天不展开：模型品牌比较、全公司平台架构、全流程一次上线。9/18 演示与下周试用仍是目标，范围和条件需本次确认。", "x": 42, "y": 688.2719999999999, "size": 10.3, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 30.488000000000003, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 795, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "VTrust · 2026/09/17 · 方向与试用范围讨论稿", "x": 42, "y": 804, "size": 9, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 13.32, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1 / 2", "x": 517.2755905511812, "y": 804, "size": 9, "w": 36, "h": 13.32, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}], [{"kind": "text", "text": "今天必须带走的 6 个决定", "x": 42, "y": 32, "size": 21, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 31.08, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "主持人速查表  |  每题写结论；未定的写清“谁补答案、何时补齐”。", "x": 42, "y": 68, "size": 10.5, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.54, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 96, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "01  优先解决哪个问题？", "x": 42, "y": 110, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "追进度、找资料、任务分派、交付确认，哪一项目前最费事？请说一个最近发生的例子。", "x": 42, "y": 135, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "第一优先：____________________  暂缓：____________________", "x": 42, "y": 161.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 210, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "02  先跑通哪一条真实流程？", "x": 42, "y": 217, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "选一个近期任务：谁安排、谁执行、交什么、谁确认？完成后谁需要知道？", "x": 42, "y": 242, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "任务：________________  安排／执行／确认：________________", "x": 42, "y": 268.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 317, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "03  哪套房、哪些人先试？", "x": 42, "y": 324, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "建议先一套房、一个阶段、少量任务。谁愿意真实使用？由谁收集反馈？", "x": 42, "y": 349, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "房屋／阶段：________________  参与人／反馈负责人：____________", "x": 42, "y": 375.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 424, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "04  什么能自动做，什么必须确认？", "x": 42, "y": 431, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "照片或语音能否先整理成草稿？谁确认完成、改期或退回？哪些资料仅特定人可见？", "x": 42, "y": 456, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "自动整理：____________  必须确认／权限边界：________________", "x": 42, "y": 482.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 531, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "05  怎样证明它值得继续投入？", "x": 42, "y": 538, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "选两条可观察的标准：本人更新、交付可追溯、无需重复追问。谁在什么时间检查？", "x": 42, "y": 563, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "通过标准：____________________  验收人／时间：______________", "x": 42, "y": 589.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 638, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "06  哪天交什么，做不完如何取舍？", "x": 42, "y": 645, "size": 13, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 19.24, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "周五最小演示包含什么？下周二凭什么决定能否试用？缺项时缩范围还是改日期，由谁定？", "x": 42, "y": 670, "size": 11.2, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 16.576, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "周五范围：________________  试用条件／拍板人：______________", "x": 42, "y": 696.576, "size": 10.4, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 15.392, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 745, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "会末复述", "x": 42, "y": 758, "size": 10.5, "w": 62, "h": 15.54, "color": "#176B73", "bold": true}, {"kind": "text", "text": "谁做什么、何时完成、如何验收。下周二 9/22 14:00–14:45 复核并决定试用安排。", "x": 109, "y": 758, "size": 10, "w": 444.27559055118115, "h": 14.8, "color": "#182E3D", "bold": false}, {"kind": "line", "x": 42, "y": 795, "w": 511.27559055118115, "color": "#D4DCE0"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "VTrust · 2026/09/17 · 方向与试用范围讨论稿", "x": 42, "y": 804, "size": 9, "w": 511.27559055118115, "h": 13.32, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2 / 2", "x": 517.2755905511812, "y": 804, "size": 9, "w": 36, "h": 13.32, "color": "#50616C", "bold": false}]]